<title>USA: US banks free rsrv $884 mln/day May 21 rvd 2 weeks.</title>
<headline>US banks free rsrv $884 mln/day May 21 rvd 2 weeks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. commercial banks had revised free reserves of $884 million per day in the two weeks ended May 21, versus revised free reserves of $1.208 billion in the previous two-week period, the Federal Reserve said.</p>
<p>Seasonal borrowings were $169 million versus $127 million a day. Extended credits were nil.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
</text>
